<PolicyLayout title="Terms of use">
  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website introduces Abrajan’s landscaping and tree services. Information
    on this site does not constitute a quote or service agreement. Please
    contact Abrajan to confirm availability, scope, and pricing.
  </p>
  <h2>Google Maps reviews</h2>
  <p>
    The Google reviews feature is subject to the{' '}
    <a
      href="https://maps.google.com/help/terms_maps/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Google Maps/Google Earth Additional Terms of Service
    </a>
    , which are incorporated here for that feature. Reviews belong to their
    authors. We display written five-star reviews from the limited selection
    Google supplies, sorted newest first within that selection. This is not the
    complete review history. The overall rating includes all ratings reported by
    Google.
  </p>
  <p>
    Review availability depends on Google and service limits. Use the links
    beside reviews to see their original sources. See our{' '}
    <a href="/privacy/">privacy information</a> for how the reviews feature
    works.
  </p>
  <h2>Estimate requests and imagery</h2>
  <p>
    Submitting an estimate request does not confirm an appointment or service
    agreement. The form is not monitored for emergency dispatch. Generated
    illustrations are labeled and do not represent completed Abrajan projects.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>
